I apologize for overcomplicating it previously! I completely understand your goal now: you just want to expand the modal to give the Big Stepper room to breathe, stack the two cards on top of each other (full width), and tweak the text/button placement inside the second card.
Here are the **2 exact changes** to apply to your current code to achieve exactly what you asked for.
### 1. Increase the Overall Popup Width
We will change the modal's maxWidth from "md" (medium) to "lg" (large) so your Big Stepper has plenty of horizontal space.
**FIND this <Dialog> tag for the View Modal (around line 927):**
```javascript
        {/* --- View Details Modal --- */}
        <Dialog
          open={isViewModalOpen}
          onClose={handleCloseViewModal}
          fullWidth
          maxWidth="md"
        >

```
**REPLACE it with this:**
```javascript
        {/* --- View Details Modal --- */}
        <Dialog
          open={isViewModalOpen}
          onClose={handleCloseViewModal}
          fullWidth
          maxWidth="lg" // <-- Changed to "lg" for extra horizontal space
        >

```
